---
#1824: `t.app` declares its own `Repo` beside a `uses` of `t.core`, whose
`Repo` `t.model`'s `Run` names. The shadow is legal, but `42` goes into
`Run.repo`, which means `t.core`'s `Repo`: a conflict at the use.
---
commons t.app

uses t.core
uses t.model

type Repo = Int

fn make() -> Run {
  Run { repo: 42 }
}
